version: "2.0"
description: >-
  GitHub Actions workflows for the monorepo. ci.yml builds and tests the 7.x
  packages on Node 24 (plus a blocking Warpline job); release.yml runs
  changesets on main; warpline-guard.yml is the advisory Warpline Guard
  self-test; gnomon.yml is the Paradigm 8.0 Gnomon CI. All of them install
  through .github/actions/install-deps.

components:
  ci-workflow:
    description: >-
      ci.yml: root build + test + typecheck on Node 24 (ubuntu), a blocking
      Warpline test job, and a publish dry run on PRs. Root `npm test` runs the
      Gnomon suites too (8.0 M3); Node 24 is the floor for every package.
    path: ci.yml
    tags: [ci]

  release-workflow:
    description: release.yml — changesets version/publish on push to main.
    path: release.yml
    tags: [ci, release]

  warpline-guard-workflow:
    description: >-
      warpline-guard.yml — advisory (continue-on-error) Warpline Guard
      self-test on PRs; never blocks.
    path: warpline-guard.yml
    tags: [ci, warpline]

  gnomon-ci:
    description: >-
      gnomon.yml (research 29 §3) — path-filtered on packages/gnomon*/** and
      .github/**. Job `test`: macos-15 / windows-latest / ubuntu-latest on Node
      24, fail-fast off, runs build:gnomon, test:gnomon (contracts, G-KRN-02,
      G-SEC-01, G-WIN-05) and typecheck. Job `probes-ci`: macos-15 /
      windows-latest, runs the probe harness self-test (p-harness) and P09/P12
      and uploads the results as artifacts. Job `native`: on macos-15 the
      unsigned swift build of gnomon-helper, the gnomon-voice-io swift build
      and tests and the gnomon-wrapper cargo test against the built kernel
      dist; on windows-latest the Rust gnomon-helper cargo test and release
      build. macos-14 is retired (T-2026-10-31-001): the macOS floor
      refusal (need 15) is covered on every host by an injected version
      (test/session-sandbox.test.ts) and the parseSwVersMajor table
      (test/macos-version.test.ts), so no 14.x runner is needed. Intended to
      become a required check once green.
    path: gnomon.yml
    tags: [ci, gnomon, paradigm-8, windows-parity]

